<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="turbo-cache-control" content="no-cache"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive"><title><%= @checklist.data['name'] %> · Private owner checklist</title><%= csp_meta_tag %>
<style>
  :root{color-scheme:light}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff;color:#171717;font:14px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}.document{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px}.tools{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px}button,.tools a{border:1px solid #777;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 14px;color:#171717;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.private-label{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#555}h1{font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;margin:8px 0}h2{font-size:20px;margin:28px 0 12px}h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:6px 0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.muted{color:#555;font-size:12px}.pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.domain{font:14px/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.service{border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:12px;break-inside:avoid}.service dl{margin:12px 0 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:5px 12px}.service dt{font-weight:600}.service dd{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px;table-layout:fixed}th,td{border:1px solid #bbb;padding:7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}th{background:#f3f3f3}.feature-name{width:24%}.feature-scope{width:38%}.feature-review{width:38%}.notice{padding:12px;border-left:3px solid #555;background:#f7f7f7;margin-top:16px}.history{margin-top:28px}footer{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #bbb;padding-top:12px;font-size:11px;color:#555}@page{margin:14mm}@media print{.tools{display:none!important}.document{max-width:none;margin:0;padding:0}body{font-size:10pt}h1{font-size:20pt}h2{font-size:14pt;break-after:avoid}h3{break-after:avoid}.service{border-radius:0}a{text-decoration:none}thead{display:table-header-group}.notice{background:none}footer{break-inside:avoid}}
</style></head><body><main class="document"><div class="tools"><button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print private copy</button><%= link_to 'Back to private checklist', owner_checklist_path(@checklist), data: { turbo: false } %></div><% data = @checklist.data %><header><p class="private-label">Private owner copy · <%= Current.tenant.name %></p><h1><%= data['name'] %></h1><p class="domain"><%= data['domain'] %></p><p class="muted">Generated <%= @printed_at.iso8601 %>. This copy contains private operating references and owner evidence.</p></header>
<section><h2>Domain purpose & contact</h2><p class="pre"><%= data['purpose'] %></p><p><strong>Owner:</strong> <%= data['owner_name'].presence || 'Not recorded' %> · <%= data['owner_email'].presence || 'Email not recorded' %><% if data['owner_phone'].present? %> · <%= data['owner_phone'] %><% end %></p><% if data['notes'].present? %><p class="pre"><%= data['notes'] %></p><% end %></section>
<section><h2>Service references</h2><p class="muted">Owner-reported references. Dates do not trigger renewals or reminders; MFA status is not provider verification. Passwords and recovery codes belong in a password manager.</p><% @checklist.services.each do |service_id, service| %><article class="service"><h3><%= service['name'] %><%= ' · Archived' if owner_service_archived?(service) %></h3><p class="pre"><%= service['purpose'] %></p><dl><dt>HTTPS login page</dt><dd><% if (login = safe_login_url(service['login_url'])) %><%= link_to login, login, target: '_blank', rel: 'nofollow noopener noreferrer', referrerpolicy: 'no-referrer' %><% else %>Not recorded<% end %></dd><dt>Renewal cadence / date</dt><dd><%= service['renewal_cadence'].to_s.humanize %> · <%= service['renewal_on'].presence || 'Date not set' %></dd><dt>Renewal notes</dt><dd class="pre"><%= service['renewal_notes'].presence || 'Not recorded' %></dd><dt>Review cadence / date</dt><dd><%= service['review_cadence'].to_s.humanize %> · <%= service['next_review_on'].presence || 'Date not set' %></dd><dt>Owner-reported MFA</dt><dd><%= service['mfa_status'].to_s.humanize %></dd><dt>Password-manager label</dt><dd><%= service['vault_reference'].presence || 'Not recorded' %></dd><dt>Support contact</dt><dd><%= [service['support_name'], service['support_email'], service['support_phone']].compact_blank.join(' · ').presence || 'Not recorded' %></dd><dt>Private service notes</dt><dd class="pre"><%= service['notes'].presence || 'Not recorded' %></dd></dl></article><% end %><% if @checklist.services.empty? %><p>No service references recorded.</p><% end %></section>
<section><h2>Current catalog & owner feature reviews</h2><p><strong><%= @reviewed_count %> of <%= @features.length %></strong> reviewed with a current scope pass or a not-required reason.</p><p class="muted">Not reviewed: <%= @review_counts.fetch('not_reviewed', 0) %> · Pending: <%= @review_counts.fetch('pending', 0) %> · Blocked: <%= @review_counts.fetch('blocked', 0) %> · Scope changed: <%= @review_counts.fetch('stale', 0) %></p><p class="notice">Code status and owner acceptance are separate. A pass covers only the stated scope and does not enable planned work or certify production readiness. New catalog features are unreviewed; a changed catalog scope makes an earlier acceptance or not-required decision stale.</p><table class="feature-catalog"><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="feature-name">Feature / current code status</th><th scope="col" class="feature-scope">Current published scope</th><th scope="col" class="feature-review">Owner review / evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @features.each do |feature| %><% review = @feature_reviews.fetch(feature['id']) %><tr><th scope="row"><%= feature['id'] %> · <%= feature['area'] %><br><%= feature['name'] %><br><span class="muted">Code: <%= feature['status'] %></span></th><td class="pre"><%= feature['scope'] %></td><td><strong><%= owner_review_label(review['status']) %></strong><p>Tested: <%= review['tested_on'].presence || 'Not recorded' %></p><p class="pre"><%= review['evidence'].presence || 'No owner evidence recorded.' %></p></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></section>
<section class="history"><h2>Recent private history</h2><p class="muted">Showing the latest <%= @events.length %> of <%= @event_count %> retained events. Earlier history remains stored; this print copy contains at most 20 events, not every historical version.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">When</th><th scope="col">Owner</th><th scope="col">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @events.each do |event| %><tr><td><%= event.created_at.iso8601 %></td><td><%= owner_event_actor(event) %></td><td><%= event.action.to_s.humanize %></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></section><footer>Private owner reference for <%= data['domain'] %>. Keep this copy secure. Keep account credentials in a password manager. This document does not perform service checks or publish owner evidence.</footer></main></body></html>
